OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786387707
OL,3,CProtesting farmers warn of
OL,4,Cdysfunctionality in Stormont department
OL,6,FFarmers have said there is
OL,7,F"institutional dysfunctionality" in
OL,8,Fthe Stormont department responsible
OL,9,Ffor agriculture.
OL,11,FThe Ulster Farmers' Union (UFU)
OL,12,Fstopped short, however, of calling for
OL,13,FDaera (Department of Agriculture,
OL,14,FEnvironment and Rural Affairs)
OL,15,FMinister Andrew Muir to resign after a
OL,16,Fcontroversy over the culling of more
OL,17,Fthan 50 cows.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786387707
OL,3,CProtesting farmers warn of
OL,4,Cdysfunctionality in Stormont department
OL,6,FHundreds of farmers protested outside
OL,7,FParliament Buildings while the
OL,8,Fminister gave evidence to his scrutiny
OL,9,Fcommittee about the row which has
OL,10,Fengulfed his department in recent
OL,11,Fweeks.
OL,13,FFarmers are angry at the shooting of
OL,14,Fthe cows, which the department has
OL,15,Fsaid followed a court order against
OL,16,Fthe cattle owner on animal safety
OL,17,Fgrounds.
OL,19,FMore than a dozen tractors parked
OL,20,Foutside Parliament Buildings and a
OL,21,Fnumber of MLAs gave speeches.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786387707
OL,3,CProtesting farmers warn of
OL,4,Cdysfunctionality in Stormont department
OL,6,FSeveral members of the UFU attended
OL,7,Fthe committee meeting to listen to the
OL,8,Fminister.
OL,10,FUFU president John McLenaghan said
OL,11,Fthey did not get the answers they were
OL,12,Flooking for.
OL,14,FHe said: "We came here looking for
OL,15,Fanswers. We sat for three hours in the
OL,16,Fcommittee room, and we came out
OL,17,Fbitterly disappointed.
OL,19,F"We got more confusion than we got
OL,20,Fclarity.
OL,26,@vD@JOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786387707
OL,3,CProtesting farmers warn of
OL,4,Cdysfunctionality in Stormont department
OL,6,F"There needed to be a recognition of
OL,7,Fthe faults that were made, and there
OL,8,Fneeded to be some contrition shown as
OL,9,Fto how we then move forward from this,
OL,10,Fbecause at some point, as an industry,
OL,11,Fwe have to get past this, we have to
OL,12,Fget over the rage, we have to move
OL,13,Fforward.
OL,15,F"We have to make our industry better
OL,16,Fbecause of this. It's hard to see that
OL,17,Fright now, but that's what we need to
OL,18,Fdo.
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786387707
OL,3,CProtesting farmers warn of
OL,4,Cdysfunctionality in Stormont department
OL,6,F"And we didn't hear anything in there
OL,7,Ftoday which reassures us that that's
OL,8,Fgoing to happen, and that is extremely
OL,9,Fdisappointing."
OL,11,FMr McLenaghan described a death threat
OL,12,Fagainst the Daera minister as
OL,13,F"deplorable".
OL,15,FHowever, he criticised Mr Muir for not
OL,16,Fyet publishing the terms of reference
OL,17,Fof an independent review into the
OL,18,Fshooting of the cows near Fivemiletown
OL,19,Fin June.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@OO]uD@AOUuD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786387707
OL,3,CProtesting farmers warn of
OL,4,Cdysfunctionality in Stormont department
OL,6,FHe said: "We don't know who's going to
OL,7,Fbe on that. Is it a panel? Is it an
OL,8,Findividual? What are they going to
OL,9,Finvestigate?
OL,11,F"So those are answers we should have
OL,12,Fhad before today."
OL,14,FWhen asked if his organisation
OL,15,Fbelieved the minister should resign,
OL,16,FMr McLenaghan said it was not about
OL,17,Findividuals.
OL,26,@nD@JOUsD@AOUtD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786387707
OL,3,CProtesting farmers warn of
OL,4,Cdysfunctionality in Stormont department
OL,6,FHe added: "We look at other issues
OL,7,Fthat we have seen as a farming
OL,8,Findustry with Daera, and what we look
OL,9,Fat when we start to look at those, we
OL,10,Fsee what we identify as an
OL,11,Finstitutional dysfunctionality within
OL,12,FDaera.
OL,14,F"We see that in this instance, we see
OL,15,Fit around the nutrient action plan
OL,16,Fproposals, and we see it around many
OL,17,Fother issues.
OL,19,F"That dysfunction is something we need
OL,20,Fto address."
OL,26,@nD@KOUvD@AOU{D@AOU|D@LO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786387707
OL,3,CProtesting farmers warn of
OL,4,Cdysfunctionality in Stormont department
OL,6,FThe union last year passed a vote of
OL,7,Fno confidence in Daera over its
OL,8,Fhandling of a number of issues.
OL,10,FMr McLenaghan said it was "obvious
OL,11,Fthings had gone wrong" in the shooting
OL,12,Fof the 51 cows in Co Tyrone.
OL,14,FHe said: "We have to explore why that
OL,15,Fhappened. We have to then understand
OL,16,Fhow we can stop that ever happening
OL,17,Fagain, and that's about that's about
OL,18,Fgetting right into the nuts and bolts
OL,19,Fof how Daera operates.
OL,26,@rD@[OUsD@VO]vD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786387707
OL,3,CProtesting farmers warn of
OL,4,Cdysfunctionality in Stormont department
OL,6,F"There has been a dysfunctionality for
OL,7,Fquite some time. We have seen it as an
OL,8,Findustry. This is just one
OL,9,Fmanifestation of it. That is what we
OL,10,Fneed to address.
OL,12,F"That's the opportunity that we have
OL,13,Fnow: is to look at that, to take that
OL,14,Fapart, to build it back better again,
OL,15,Fand support what is our largest single
OL,16,Fand most important industry."
OL,18,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,19,FITVX
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUxD@]O]
